    "title": "Types of Sand Used in Construction and Their Uses",
    "excerpt": "Sand is an essential material in construction, used in concrete, brick masonry, wall plastering and various infrastructure projects. However, not every type of sand is suitable for every job. Particle size, shape, grading and cleanliness influence how sand performs when mixed with cement, water and other aggregates.",
    "desc": "Sand is an essential material in construction, used in concrete, brick masonry, wall plastering and various infrastructure projects. However, not every type of sand is suitable for every job. Particle size, shape, grading and cleanliness influence how sand performs when mixed with cement, water and other aggregates.",
    "tag": "TECHNOLOGY & INNOVATIONS",
