    "title": "M Sand vs P Sand: Differences, Uses, Advantages and Applications",
    "excerpt": "Choosing the right sand is an important part of construction because it affects the workability, quality and finish of cement-based mixtures. Whether you are building a house, preparing concrete or plastering walls, selecting sand according to the requirements of the job can help avoid material wastage and construction problems. M Sand and P Sand are two commonly used manufactured sand products but they are intended for different applications.",
    "desc": "Choosing the right sand is an important part of construction because it affects the workability, quality and finish of cement-based mixtures. Whether you are building a house, preparing concrete or plastering walls, selecting sand according to the requirements of the job can help avoid material wastage and construction problems. M Sand and P Sand are two commonly used manufactured sand products but they are intended for different applications.",
    "tag": "TECHNOLOGY & INNOVATIONS",
