    "title": "Factors That Affect M-Sand Plant Output and Product Quality",
    "excerpt": "Manufactured sand, commonly known as M-sand, has become an important alternative to natural river sand in construction. As demand grows for concrete, residential buildings, roads and infrastructure projects, the need for reliable M-sand production continues to increase. A properly designed M-sand plant helps convert suitable rock into manufactured sand with controlled particle size, shape, and grading.",
    "desc": "Manufactured sand, commonly known as M-sand, has become an important alternative to natural river sand in construction. As demand grows for concrete, residential buildings, roads and infrastructure projects, the need for reliable M-sand production continues to increase. A properly designed M-sand plant helps convert suitable rock into manufactured sand with controlled particle size, shape, and grading.",
    "tag": "TECHNOLOGY & INNOVATIONS",
