    "excerpt": "Manufactured sand, also known as M-sand, has become an important alternative to natural river sand in India's construction industry. With growing demand for concrete, roads and infrastructure projects, crusher manufacturers and plant operators need equipment that delivers consistent sand quality, reliable production and manageable operating costs.",
    "desc": "Manufactured sand, also known as M-sand, has become an important alternative to natural river sand in India's construction industry. With growing demand for concrete, roads and infrastructure projects, crusher manufacturers and plant operators need equipment that delivers consistent sand quality, reliable production and manageable operating costs.",
    "tag": "TECHNOLOGY & INNOVATIONS",
